flowchart TD
  U[Client] --> I[Ingress / Gateway<br/>TLS · host and path routing]
  I --> S[Service: orders<br/>stable DNS + virtual IP]
  S --> P1[Pod orders-a<br/>ready ✓]
  S --> P2[Pod orders-b<br/>ready ✓]
  S -. not ready: no traffic .-> P3[Pod orders-c<br/>starting]
  D[Deployment: orders<br/>image · replicas · strategy] --> RS[ReplicaSet<br/>current revision]
  RS --> P1
  RS --> P2
  RS --> P3
  H[HPA] -. adjusts replicas .-> D
  CM[ConfigMap / Secret] -. env and files .-> P1
